{"title":"The Leather Wolvhammer is Back. Updated 45NRTH Winter Boots Land Just in Time for Winter","link":"https://bikerumor.com/the-leather-wolvhammer-is-back-updated-45nrth-winter-boots-land-just-in-time-for-winter/","date":1794585192000,"content":"<p><img src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-162-1536x1025.jpg\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1025\" alt=\"45NRTH updated Leather Wolvhammer\" /></p>\n<p>The coming winter has a bit more uncertainty than usual thanks to a strong El Nino forecast. While some may get less snow than usual, some are preparing for an epic winter. There aren’t many cycling brands out there that can conquer the cold like Minnesota’s 45NRTH. A few months ago, 45NRTH launched some new <a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/45nrth-rolls-out-new-levitas-carbon-fat-bike-rim-in-27-5-26-sizes/\" target=\"_blank\">carbon fat bike rims</a> supporting the winter fat tire cyclist. Today, they are in the news again with an update to their popular winter riding boots, the Leather Wolvhammer and the Ragnarok.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-162-scaled.jpg\"><img width=\"2560\" height=\"1708\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-162-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"45NRTH updated Leather Wolvhammer\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-162-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-162-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-162-1536x1025.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-162-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-162-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-162-2048x1366.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-162-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-162-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-162-1349x900.jpg 1349w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-053-Edit-scaled.jpg\"><img width=\"2560\" height=\"1708\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-053-Edit-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"45NRTH updated Ragnarok\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-053-Edit-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-053-Edit-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-053-Edit-1536x1025.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-053-Edit-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-053-Edit-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-053-Edit-2048x1366.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-053-Edit-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-053-Edit-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-053-Edit-1349x900.jpg 1349w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<h2>Leather Wolvhammer</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>That’s right, the leather Wolvhammer is back. <a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/hands-on-45nrth-x-red-wing-leather-limited-edition-wolvhammer-winter-cycling-boot/\" target=\"_blank\">First introduced as a limited edition collaboration with Red Wing Leather</a>, the OG leather Wolvhammer is still one of Zach’s favorite winter cycling boots of all time due to how well the leather has broken in over the years. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>To be clear, the new leather Wolvhammer has nothing to do with Red Wing, and the construction of the boot is substantially different. Now featuring a large BOA dial for the lower section of the boot and a large Velcro strap on the upper, the new boot is suggested for 0 – 25F (-18 – -4C) temperatures, though 45NRTH isn’t putting an official temperature rating on the boots due to how varied personal preference can be. Just know that the Ragnarok below sits one temperature rung above the Wolvhammer for slightly warmer conditions. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>Leather Wolvhammer is available in sizes 38-48 and 50. In Canada, these will only be available through IBD, but in the U.S. they will also be available direct to consumers. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>Retail: $325 ($460 CAD)</p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-198-scaled.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1025\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-198-1536x1025.jpg\" alt=\"45NRTH updated Leather Wolvhammer\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-198-1536x1025.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-198-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-198-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-198-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-198-2048x1366.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-198-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-198-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-198-1349x900.jpg 1349w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>We haven’t tried these yet, so we can’t comment for sure, but the cleat pocket appears to be closer to the inboard side of the outsole, like the last gen Wolvhammer that we tested. That’s good to prevent heel rub, but potentially not so good if you’re trying to maintain the narrowest Q-factor on your fat bike. Just something to keep in mind since as soon as you put cleats on the boots to test out the position, you will likely be unable to return them. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-160-scaled-e1794512853590.jpg\"><img width=\"1673\" height=\"1390\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-160-scaled-e1794512853590.jpg\" alt=\"45NRTH updated Leather Wolvhammer\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-160-scaled-e1794512853590.jpg 1673w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-160-scaled-e1794512853590-297x247.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-160-scaled-e1794512853590-1536x1276.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-160-scaled-e1794512853590-120x100.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-160-scaled-e1794512853590-768x638.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-160-scaled-e1794512853590-1083x900.jpg 1083w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>New upper design with single-boot construction</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Same 200g insulation for thermal protection</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Premium leather upper material for good looks and protection on the outside, and a lining with a waterproof membrane on the inside for comfort and protection from the elements</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Two-bolt pedal system for ultimate connection to your ride</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Aero Gel foam pioneered by NASA provides non-compressible, ultra-lightweight insulation underfoot</li>\n\n\n\n<li>BOA dial system for optimized fit</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>*<em>Please note that one of the materials in the Leather Wolvhammer was exposed to PFAS, and as a result, these boots do not meet legal PFAS requirements in CA, NM, RI, and WA. While this product was not specified with DWR coating or any other restricted material, a supply chain issue resulted in small amounts being measured in the final product</em>.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-213-scaled.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1025\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-213-1536x1025.jpg\" alt=\"45NRTH updated Leather Wolvhammer\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-213-1536x1025.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-213-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-213-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-213-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-213-2048x1366.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-213-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-213-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-213-1349x900.jpg 1349w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-206-scaled.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1025\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-206-1536x1025.jpg\" alt=\"45NRTH updated Leather Wolvhammer\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-206-1536x1025.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-206-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-206-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-206-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-206-2048x1366.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-206-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-206-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-206-1349x900.jpg 1349w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<h2>Ragnarok</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-059-Edit-scaled-e1794512586303.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1111\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-059-Edit-scaled-e1794512586303-1536x1111.jpg\" alt=\"45NRTH updated Ragnarok\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-059-Edit-scaled-e1794512586303-1536x1111.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-059-Edit-scaled-e1794512586303-297x215.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-059-Edit-scaled-e1794512586303-120x87.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-059-Edit-scaled-e1794512586303-768x556.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-059-Edit-scaled-e1794512586303-1244x900.jpg 1244w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-059-Edit-scaled-e1794512586303.jpg 1970w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The Ragnarok is still the boot for shoulder seasons with a suggested temperature range of 25F+ (-4C+). If deep winter cycling isn’t your thing, but you want something to keep your feet warm and dry up until the snow flies, these could be the ticket. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>Ragnarok is available in sizes 36-48 and 50 and continues with a BOA fit system, but introduces a new lace path and a completely revised Velcro cuff. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>Retail: $245 ($350 CAD)</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Updated upper with high-quality Clarino microfiber for a supple, leather-like feel</li>\n\n\n\n<li>New lace path for BOA to add strength to the closure and a more secure fit</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Gray EVA midsole with black speckles</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Neoprene ankle cuff for more flexibility</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Same trustworthy rubber outsole with anti-slip microglass rubber blocks</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-055-Edit-scaled.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1025\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-055-Edit-1536x1025.jpg\" alt=\"45NRTH updated Ragnarok\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-055-Edit-1536x1025.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-055-Edit-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-055-Edit-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-055-Edit-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-055-Edit-2048x1366.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-055-Edit-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-055-Edit-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-055-Edit-1349x900.jpg 1349w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-054-Edit-scaled.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1025\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-054-Edit-1536x1025.jpg\" alt=\"45NRTH updated Ragnarok\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-054-Edit-1536x1025.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-054-Edit-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-054-Edit-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-054-Edit-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-054-Edit-2048x1366.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-054-Edit-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-054-Edit-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20260805_45N_RAG_WOLV-054-Edit-1349x900.jpg 1349w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>45NRTH believes that winter riding can be magical. From quiet trails to crisp, cold winter air, they can equip you for all things winter. Hit the link below for all of the cold-weather gear.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><em><a href=\"https://www.45nrth.com/\" target=\"_blank\">45NRTH.com</a></em></p>","author":"Ron Frazelle","comments":"https://bikerumor.com/the-leather-wolvhammer-is-back-updated-45nrth-winter-boots-land-just-in-time-for-winter/#respond","siteTitle":"Bikerumor","siteHash":"49f427af0a926f4232eb837006841d7242e153e3afbb590f32e4b104ea3e2718","entryHash":"b3c1db0bb3fd2cfce6222931d1b2ee9dc357e31cb126121528be89448d053195","category":"Cycling"}